  "dzh": "1628年，大明崇祯元年。陕西大旱、流民四起，后金皇太极陈兵辽东；这一年，五百余名来自四百年后的穿越者带着工业时代的机器与知识，在海南临高百仞滩登陆。西方三十年战争方酣，古斯塔夫·阿道夫即将挥师德意志；奥斯曼、萨法维、莫卧儿三大帝国鼎立，荷兰、西班牙、葡萄牙的商船往来南洋。",
  "den": "AD 1628, the first year of Chongzhen. Drought and banditry spread across Shaanxi and Hong Taiji's Later Jin presses on Liaodong; on the beach of Bairen at Lingao, Hainan, five hundred travellers from four centuries ahead land with the machines and knowledge of the industrial age. In the West the Thirty Years' War rages and Gustavus Adolphus is about to march into Germany; the Ottoman, Safavid and Mughal empires stand at their height, while Dutch, Spanish and Portuguese ships ply the Indies.",
